      "id": "claim_55f7420df658424d8aa1ae27a578868f",
      "statement": "Order creation (POST /api/v1/orders) runs fraud detection and compliance gates (legal ordering hours 10-22 Asia/Kolkata, age >= 21 from stored dateOfBirth, single-restaurant cart), then executes stock validation, atomic guarded stock decrement (findOneAndUpdate with countInStock >= qty and $inc -qty, auto-disabling products at 0), server-side price recomputation (variants/addons, strict coupon validation, 5% tax, tip clamp 0-500, 15% restaurant commission), and optional atomic wallet deduction — all inside a MongoDB transaction that aborts on any failure with a 400.",
