      "id": "claim_40c82c88134e489d8204e10fd620d27d",
      "statement": "Online payment orders are created with orderStatus 'Payment Pending' and a 30-minute expiresAt, while COD/Wallet orders are 'Placed'; Wallet payment marks the order isPaid immediately, and post-commit side effects (SwadCoins loyalty, customer/admin/restaurant emails, newOrderReceived socket to the restaurant owner, push notifications, productUpdated stock broadcasts) are each non-blocking try/catch blocks.",
