    {
      "id": "claim_400b2bcd884b4510bbd7583440bc919c",
      "statement": "The Razorpay webhook (POST /api/v1/payment/webhook) verifies x-razorpay-signature against the raw body with RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET using crypto.timingSafeEqual and settles payment.captured/authorized events via an atomic conditional update findOneAndUpdate({ _id, isPaid: false }, { isPaid: true, ... }) so duplicate webhook delivery produces no side effects.",
