    {
      "id": "claim_285237a832f5482c8ba7a0f1641f40f6",
      "statement": "Order status transitions are validated by a strict VALID_TRANSITIONS map (Payment Pending -> Placed/Cancelled -> Preparing -> Ready -> Out for Delivery -> Delivered, Delivered terminal), owners are scoped to their own restaurant's orders, Delivered can only be set via the OTP delivery endpoint, and on 'Ready' the nearest available delivery_partner within 5 km ($nearSphere) is atomically claimed (isAvailable: false) with a crypto.randomInt 4-digit deliveryOTP generated and ETA recalculated.",
